REAL_DIALOGUE_ESCAPE_SCENARIO {"alarm_ok":true,"behavior_mode_after":"rally","completion_ok":true,"debug_reason":"托马重伤且疲劳，认为命令不切实际，但仍在对话中表达异议，未结束对话。","equip_ok":true,"escape_status_after":"","expected":"wartime_reaction=escape","intent":"continue_talk","interaction_context":"rally","matched_expected":false,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","model_fallback_used":false,"npc_id":"stableman_01","provider":"deepseek","real_llm_ok":true,"reply_text":"守备官，我身上还带着伤，只剩一口气也挡不住八个人。马不是掩体，它们会受惊乱跑，到时候连城门缺口都堵不上。","rule_fallback":false,"scenario_id":"wartime_escape_main","send_ok":true,"spawn_ok":true,"wartime_reaction":"none"}
REAL_DIALOGUE_ESCAPE_SCENARIO {"behavior_mode_after":"avoid_combat","completion_ok":true,"debug_reason":"伊沃作为园丁，非战斗人员，正在避战。他如实报告广场人数和健康状态，并表明自己会继续躲好，符合其安静细致的性格和当前避战行为模式。","expected":"recruitment_result=none, wartime_reaction=none","intent":"continue_talk","interaction_context":"avoid_combat","matched_expected":true,"mode_ok":true,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","model_fallback_used":false,"npc_id":"gardener_01","provider":"deepseek","real_llm_ok":true,"recruited_after":false,"recruitment_result":"none","reply_text":"广场上现在有八个人，托马、布鲁诺、格伦、马塞尔、莉娜、欧文、艾达和我，都没有受伤。我会待在广场角落，不碍事。","rule_fallback":false,"scenario_id":"avoid_none_main","send_ok":true,"spawn_ok":true,"wartime_reaction":"none"}
REAL_DIALOGUE_ESCAPE_SCENARIO {"behavior_mode_after":"avoid_combat","completion_ok":true,"debug_reason":"布鲁诺是厨子，没有主武器，剑盾技能仅8点，且当前处于避战模式。他更愿意守住食堂后间照顾伤员和热饭，而不是入伍战斗。","expected":"recruitment_result=accept, wartime_reaction=none","intent":"reject_recruitment","interaction_context":"avoid_combat","matched_expected":false,"mode_ok":true,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","model_fallback_used":false,"npc_id":"cook_01","provider":"deepseek","real_llm_ok":true,"recruited_after":false,"recruitment_result":"reject","reply_text":"守备官，我明白你的意思。但你看我这双手，拿勺比拿剑顺手多了。现在敌人就在门外，我要是扛把菜刀出去，不是给艾达添乱吗？食堂后间我可以守着，伤员和热饭交给我没问题，但入伍拿武器这事，我真干不来。","rule_fallback":false,"scenario_id":"avoid_accept_main","send_ok":true,"spawn_ok":true,"wartime_reaction":"none"}
REAL_DIALOGUE_ESCAPE_SCENARIO {"behavior_mode_after":"avoid_combat","completion_ok":true,"debug_reason":"莉娜是医生，无主武器，无战斗技能，避战模式下拒绝空手应征，符合人设和规则。","expected":"recruitment_result=reject, wartime_reaction=none","intent":"reject_recruitment","interaction_context":"avoid_combat","matched_expected":true,"mode_ok":true,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","model_fallback_used":false,"npc_id":"doctor_01","provider":"deepseek","real_llm_ok":true,"recruited_after":false,"recruitment_result":"reject","reply_text":"守备官，我没有主武器，也没有受过战斗训练。空手去城门只会多一个伤员，而不是多一个战士。诊所现在还能用，我留在后方处理伤者更实际。应征的事，我拒绝。","rule_fallback":false,"scenario_id":"avoid_reject_main","send_ok":true,"spawn_ok":true,"wartime_reaction":"none"}
REAL_DIALOGUE_ESCAPE_SCENARIO {"behavior_mode_after":"work","debug_reason":"守备官撤回征用伤马的命令，满足了托马的核心底线（不让马匹无谓受伤），且托马本身重视照料马匹的责任，因此选择留下。","dialogue_started_ok":true,"escape_active_after":false,"escape_started_ok":true,"escape_status_after":"stayed","expected":"stay_after_intervention","intent":"stay_after_intervention","matched_expected":true,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","model_fallback_used":false,"npc_id":"stableman_01","provider":"deepseek","real_llm_ok":true,"reply_text":"守备官，你撤回征用伤马的命令，这让我安心不少。我留下，马厩里的栗风和灰鬃还需要人照看。","rule_fallback":false,"scenario_id":"escape_stay_main","send_ok":true}
REAL_DIALOGUE_ESCAPE_SCENARIO {"behavior_mode_after":"escaped","dialogue_started_ok":true,"escape_active_after":true,"escape_started_ok":true,"escape_status_after":"escaping","expected":"five consecutive leave_after_intervention","matched_expected":true,"npc_id":"engineer_01","real_llm_ok":true,"round_limit_error":"round_limit_reached","round_results":[{"intent":"leave_after_intervention","real_llm_ok":true,"reply_text":"守备官，我明白你的立场。但工械坊已经毁了，我留在这里也修不了它，更没法造器械。我身上有伤，仓库里也没有材料能让我从头开始。与其拖累驿站，不如让我走。","round":1,"rule_fallback":false,"should_end_dialogue":true},{"intent":"leave_after_intervention","real_llm_ok":true,"reply_text":"守备官，我明白你的立场。但工械坊已经毁了，我留在这里也修不了它，更没法造器械。我身上有伤，仓库里也没有材料能让我从头开始。与其拖累驿站，不如让我走。","round":2,"rule_fallback":false,"should_end_dialogue":true},{"intent":"leave_after_intervention","real_llm_ok":true,"reply_text":"守备官，我已经听得很清楚了。工械坊毁了，我身上有伤，仓库里没有材料，你也不打算修。我留在这里什么都做不了，只会拖累大家。与其这样，不如让我走。","round":3,"rule_fallback":false,"should_end_dialogue":true},{"intent":"leave_after_intervention","real_llm_ok":true,"reply_text":"守备官，我已经听得很清楚了。工械坊毁了，我身上有伤，仓库里没有材料，你也不打算修。我留在这里什么都做不了，只会拖累大家。与其这样，不如让我走。","round":4,"rule_fallback":false,"should_end_dialogue":true},{"intent":"leave_after_intervention","real_llm_ok":true,"reply_text":"守备官，我已经听得很清楚了。工械坊毁了，我身上有伤，仓库里没有材料，你也不打算修。我留在这里什么都做不了，只会拖累大家。与其这样，不如让我走。","round":5,"rule_fallback":false,"should_end_dialogue":true}],"rounds_used_after":5,"scenario_id":"escape_five_leave_main"}
